regiondemagallanes-by-faemiyah (1.0+git20240828-0ddebs4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patches : added 06_load-flac-soundtrack.patch, the intro
    reads the FLAC soundtrack directly with libsndfile
  * debian/patches : added 07_enable-vsync.patch, VSync is requested
    with SDL_GL_SetSwapInterval(1) after the GL context is created
  * debian/patches : added DEP-3 headers to 04_update-cmake.patch and
    05_fullscreen.patch, comments of the fullscreen code in English
  * debian/*-data.postinst, debian/*-data.prerm : removed, the FLAC file
    is no longer converted back to WAV in /usr/share at install time
  * debian/control : added libsndfile1-dev and pkgconf, cmake (>= 3.16),
    sox moved to Build-Depends-Indep, sox dropped from the data package
    Depends, common-install-function-ddebs dropped (no launcher script),
    versioned dependency on the data package, Homepage points to Pouet,
    Vcs-* fields, longer descriptions
  * debian/rules : FLAC compression done in override_dh_install-indep
    only, debian/clean removes the generated file, -DUSE_LD removed
    (already defined by CMakeLists.txt)
  * debian/copyright : upstream licence is BSD-3-Clause (LICENCE file),
    SDL2.dll is Zlib, Upstream-Contact filled
  * debian/resources : the icon was an empty file, now made from the
    upstream screenshot
  * debian/source/lintian-overrides : Windows binaries of the upstream
    release
  * debian/README.Debian, debian/regiondemagallanes-by-faemiyah.6.md :
    updated, documented the options and the F and Esc keys

 -- Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:21:50 +0100

